function chordToPitches(symbol,dest='piano'){const m=String(symbol||'').match(/^([A-G])([#b]?)(m|maj7|m7|7|dim|sus4)?/);if(!m)return[];const semis={C:0,D:2,E:4,F:5,G:7,A:9,B:11},acc=m[2]==='#'?1:m[2]==='b'?-1:0,root=(semis[m[1]]+acc+12)%12,q=m[3]||'',ints=q==='m'?[0,3,7]:q==='dim'?[0,3,6]:q==='sus4'?[0,5,7]:q==='7'?[0,4,7,10]:q==='maj7'?[0,4,7,11]:q==='m7'?[0,3,7,10]:[0,4,7],base=(dest==='accordion'?48:36)+root;return ints.map(i=>base+i)}
